  dialog: I wasn't expecting an Assessment today, what can I help you with?
  correctDialog: Of course, it seems I don't have my Slates. Bring me them from the
    back office, and we can start the procedure.
  okDialog: Of course, it seems I don't have my Slates. Bring me them from the back
